            "fact_ids": [
              "aws.ecs_task_identity#f1",
              "aws.ecs_task_identity#f2",
              "aws.ecs_task_identity#f3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "Verify both application operations from the task under the approved task role. In this case, the audit read must succeed and the audit write must return AccessDenied. A successful read alone is insufficient; if the write succeeds, the supplied least-privilege boundary has not been verified, even when taskRoleArn names the approved role.",
